説明した。"],"headline":"八丈町で震度1　小笠原諸島西方沖でM7.0","permalink":"../../../articles/4a96b560a25d6b427b629ada/","public_id":"4a96b560a25d6b427b629ada","sources":[{"label":"気象庁（2026-10-25更新）","url":"https://www.jma.go.jp/bosai/quake/data/20261025111715_20261025111028_VXSE5k_1.json"}]},{"article_id":"07cfbc0f2ffaba366641e886","body":["八丈島空港ターミナルビルは10月21日付の公式ページで、台風により当初の日程を延期した「八丈島空港空の日イベント」を18日に縮小開催したと報告した。"],"headline":"八丈島空港「空の日」、18日に縮小開催と報告","permalink":"../../../articles/07cfbc0f2ffaba366641e886/","public_id":"07cfbc0f2ffaba366641e886","sources":[{"label":"八丈島空港ターミナルビル（2026-10-21更新）","url":"https://hachijoapo.net/archives/4244"}]}],"date":"2026-10-27","evidence_cutoff_at":"2026-10-27T02:46:16.982500+00:00","issue_kind":"formal","paper_name":"八丈島新聞","reading_mode":"scroll","reference_sections":[],"revision":{"actual_published_at":"2026-10-27T02:52:02.071689+00:00","finalized_at":"2026-10-27T02:46:22.852917+00:00","knowledge_cutoff_at":"2026-10-27T02:46:16.982500+00:00","number":2,"production_requirement_met":false},"view_mode":"article-review-v1"}